h medications?</p></span></div><div data-rid="69d7c33b-8b9e-4953-883a-2cb4cfbfeaec" class="r-sqblmz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1daf4ut" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5mb2:"><div data-rid="f2cb37bb-d71a-4d93-b143-5e1381b622c8" class="r-q668r0"><div data-rid="023e5f3f-31e8-47f1-a017-7c438d531882" class="r-1bmy7fw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The natural ingredients in the Longevity Shot are generally well-tolerated, but everyone is unique. If you’re taking any prescription medications or have a medical condition, particularly autoimmune conditions, we encourage you to consult your healthcare provider before starting the Longevity Shot.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="51b51638-9b8c-484c-9778-7938aa0b10c7" class="r-rs5q95" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="2c65d7ec-74a2-4f37-b257-1b05b41e0c72" aria-controls="replo-:R6mb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1o5ym6s"><div data-rid="3650916f-4cbb-414d-a132-fe75da0467a3" class="r-1jvlk0y alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does the Longevity Shot contain sugar or alcohol?</p></span></div><div data-rid="1bb7582d-dfff-458a-884e-dd721186836a" class="r-qi18j5"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1etto2h" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R6mb2:"><div data-rid="fc4935da-7f48-4a36-b9bf-a769119985aa" class="r-lcyo3n"><div data-rid="a7b3eb82-884b-4144-9d48-2960146a61ba" class="r-3afqpy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot contains 2.5 grams of natural sugar from apple and grape juice concentrate. It is also lightly sweetened with steviol glycosides, a natural sweetener derived from the Stevia rebaudiana plant that is sugar and calorie-free. It is alcohol-free.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7e65dab1-6f97-49d5-ba30-fd9aad2ec84c" class="r-6qq898" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="fe157dc0-62f1-4e7b-9a56-ed043a02ef85" aria-controls="replo-:R7mb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-19by7fi"><div data-rid="891df2a7-45f5-46fb-be4e-4e659781ed5b" class="r-1rzj2in alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take the Longevity Shot if I’m pregnant or breastfeeding?</p></span></div><div data-rid="8701a4da-80c9-4881-abec-6127541e7a91" class="r-1ari2ay"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-15nsmes" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7mb2:"><div data-rid="7e670576-8575-4140-bf92-a2348548d2af" class="r-1pdl85"><div data-rid="6d92bb14-d219-4fea-a3ae-92097f620b6a" class="r-1y9v6q alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>While the Longevity Shot is made with natural ingredients, we always recommend that pregnant or breastfeeding women consult their healthcare provider to ensure it aligns with their unique health needs during this time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4e47e3d3-34c9-425f-8dc3-d3cb728b1cc8" class="r-aebb6y" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="932c5c46-6535-4f81-98c9-9b631a671256" aria-controls="replo-:R8mb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ibm6mz"><div data-rid="a4247aad-b397-4823-b177-553a6e6c99b3" class="r-1lrc5zq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot suitable for children or teenagers?</p></span></div><div data-rid="1100db5e-1c53-475d-a996-bf95d386b0bf" class="r-1bvdme9"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-5qcz18" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R8mb2:"><div data-rid="6e430768-1afe-4485-8d03-81f9a6d074e5" class="r-16cfan2"><div data-rid="28134970-fdbf-4061-b774-5fab9f557755" class="r-1o9j6ia alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot is formulated with adults in mind. If you’re considering it for children or teenagers, we recommend speaking with a healthcare provider to ensure it’s appropriate for their needs.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d68462f6-315b-4481-9ae0-f40ef0be487a" class="r-1kbvps5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="17bd2629-7cb6-418a-a787-75825a6fbdc0" aria-controls="replo-:R9mb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-5nfio8"><div data-rid="29aeeec4-782f-4c58-b3a5-6814bb0a12ea" class="r-kgsrv7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot safe for those with allergies or dietary restrictions?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b0db70f7-607e-482f-8dfc-e7ffb46697b2" class="r-qwb0v2"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-tuc8mz" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R9mb2:"><div data-rid="babc6eb2-7590-414c-8d87-82c8ce592d46" class="r-f1yjbf"><div data-rid="0463f255-79a1-418d-9e8a-020de2002c21" class="r-lsle83 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, the Longevity Shot is free from common allergens like nuts, soy, dairy, and gluten, making it suitable for most women with dietary sensitivities. Additionally, it can fit into most keto diets.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="01662595-a82f-4462-822e-9cabb95b2b80" class="r-1urtcts" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="0faf106c-01a9-4095-9f69-2742881ea36c" aria-controls="replo-:Ramb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6lpwsx"><div data-rid="8d0364d2-e0ef-4a9e-bf12-da1e09e2d858" class="r-1fnbwzk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shots tested on animals?</p></span></div><div data-rid="7a62ace6-b50e-469f-b105-6a8e43b06a69" class="r-i0bsm3"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1yvpje8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Ramb2:"><div data-rid="c58ab435-f57c-45b1-8637-93574512c527" class="r-j3azyq"><div data-rid="a04e7218-d5d1-463b-9db4-9fe6162be88b" class="r-twy8b0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No, the Longevity Shot is not tested on animals.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9cec3e6b-a6d2-4e13-85d3-50c4283c3ffc" class="r-mtombw" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="1f2876bb-75c3-430e-a495-e5f7a6dc41b1" aria-controls="replo-:Rbmb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1spnjlb"><div data-rid="124b5bbb-db17-421f-9478-8ed835c8788f" class="r-1tckz18 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is t